  "question": {
    "text": "The remainder when <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>19</mn><mn>200</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>23</mn><mn>200</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is divided by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>49</mn></math>, is _____ ."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "29",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Solving&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>19</mn><mn>200</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>23</mn><mn>200</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>21</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>200</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>21</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>200</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>200</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mn>21</mn></mfenced><mn>200</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>200</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mn>21</mn></mfenced><mn>198</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>200</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>200</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mn>21</mn></mfenced><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>200</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now we know that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>21</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>441</mn></math>&nbsp;is divisible by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>49</mn></math>,</p><p>So rest of the terms will be divisible by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>49</mn></math>&nbsp;</p><p>So lets consider for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>200</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>200</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mn>21</mn></mfenced><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>200</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>201</mn></msup></math></p><p>Now rewriting the term&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>201</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mfenced><mn>67</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>67</mn></msup></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>67</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>67</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>67</mn></mmultiscripts><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>67</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>7</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>67</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>49</mn><mi>k</mi></math></p><p>Now when dividing&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>67</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>49</mn></math>&nbsp;we consider <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>67</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>7</mn></math>&nbsp;as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>49</mn><mi>k</mi></math>&nbsp;is divisible by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>49</mn></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>67</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>470</mn></math>&nbsp;which when divided by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>49</mn></math>&nbsp;leaves remainder as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>29</mn></math>.</p>"
